document-processor, JSON mapping, mappingFile, paragraph-level, section_in_brd, reason_for_mapping, keyPoints, condensed, confidence, requires_review, ambiguity_flag, document_name, paragraph_index, .claude/GATHER-business-analyst/document-mappings, timestamp, totalDocuments, totalParagraphs, sectionDistribution, DOCX conversion, PDF conversion, markdown in memory, template exclusion, semantic mapping, Business Context, Business Rules, Functional Requirements, Non-Functional Requirements
